      "value": "@{5cfb491476b5b77800e860ec|full_name}\n\n本件は操作性の問題ではなく、表示の問題です。\n\nOSCによるカメラ制御で解決する問題ではありません。\n\nThis is not an issue with operability, but rather a display issue.\n\nIt is not a problem that can be resolved by controlling the camera via OSC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
